    "_comment": "Pillow's RASTERISATION of a gradient, sampled. Cross-checked in a real browser against the identical ctx.createLinearGradient fill built from lib/gradient.ts's gradientLine: worst channel delta 3/255 over all 21 probes, which is the quantisation of Pillow's 256-step LUT against the browser's continuous interpolation. Probes deliberately include points OUTSIDE the box, where both must clamp to an end stop. Asserted from Python only (node has no Canvas); a change to _GRADIENT_STEPS or to the stop-sampling rule fails here."
